ul you know i've got to carry a sword  a wreath for the armistice thing i don't  want to carry a bloody bat on as well  and it was typical of him he didn't fuss  about these sorts of things you know  he was down to earth and uh i say a very  great man  yeah a straight talker lord alan west  thank you very much for sharing your  memories of the duke with us
 

